Output examples/demo/out/input.gif

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1200
Set Height 280
Set FontSize 22
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./xylitol.sh input --header='Input:' --placeholder='This is placeholder!'"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "Hello, xylitol!"
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
